label: Lookup Township
description: >-
  Ask Michigan's statewide Minor Civil Division layer which township contains
  this point. The host performs the HTTP.

  blue-ribbon's `fetchTownship`, township-lookup.ts:35.

  Its output is `provenance: verified` even though this is a third party,
  because the statewide layer is more authoritative than the county's own
  township field -- Roscommon's maps ID 11 to two different townships. Trust
  is not monotone in distance from the primary source.
effect: http
input: ParcelCentroid
output: TownshipLookup
examples:
  - given:
      ParcelCentroid:
        pin: "062-026-300-020-00"
        lng: -83.35
        lat: 44.44
    expect:
      TownshipLookup:
        pin: "062-026-300-020-00"
        township: "Oscoda"
        provenance: "verified"
        vintageAsOf: "2026-08-30"
        vintageSourceType: "periodic"
        vintageNote: "statewide MCD point-in-polygon; county layer has no township field"
